UNDERLYING SOURCE DATA
----------------------

This project does not claim any rights over the source observations. Those
remain with the issuing agencies:

  * Air quality observations
    Ministry of Environment, Republic of China (Taiwan) / 中華民國環境部
    https://airtw.moenv.gov.tw/  ·  https://data.moenv.gov.tw/

  * Meteorological observations
    Central Weather Administration, MOTC / 交通部中央氣象署
    https://opendata.cwa.gov.tw/

  * ERA5 reanalysis
    Generated using Copernicus Climate Change Service information.
    Neither the European Commission nor ECMWF is responsible for any use that
    may be made of the Copernicus information or data it contains.

  * Sentinel-5P
    Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data.

  * MODIS
    Courtesy of NASA.


IMPORTANT — REDISTRIBUTION OF SOURCE DATA IS UNRESOLVED
-------------------------------------------------------

Two statements issued by the Ministry of Environment conflict on whether the
raw air quality observations may be redistributed. See docs/legal.md for the
full analysis. Until that is resolved, this repository publishes derived
products and the pipeline needed to regenerate them, rather than a wholesale
copy of the raw hourly records.


